/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   §05  RUNNER SCRIPT INTEGRATION
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   The runner launcher is the primary entry point for ASH CLI shortcuts.
   These binds (in keybinds/default.conf) invoke it:

   # Primary runner — all modes combined
   bind = $mainMod, space, exec, \
     rofi -show combi \
          -config ~/.config/rofi/launchers/type-7-runner/launcher.rasi

   # App-only mode
   bind = $mainMod, D, exec, \
     rofi -show drun \
          -config ~/.config/rofi/launchers/type-7-runner/launcher.rasi

   # Shell command mode
   bind = $mainMod, R, exec, \
     rofi -show run \
          -config ~/.config/rofi/launchers/type-7-runner/launcher.rasi

   # Window switcher mode
   bind = $mainMod, W, exec, \
     rofi -show window \
          -config ~/.config/rofi/launchers/type-7-runner/launcher.rasi

   # Calculator mode (rofi-calc plugin required)
   bind = $mainMod ALT, C, exec, \
     rofi -show calc -modi "calc:qalc +u8 -nocurrencies" \
          -config ~/.config/rofi/launchers/type-7-runner/launcher.rasi

   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   §06  PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION NOTES
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   • use drun-use-desktop-cache = true for faster startup on repeat launches
   • set max-history-size = 20 to limit history file size
   • icon-theme "Papirus-Dark" loads faster than symlink-heavy themes
   • fuzzy matching + fzf sorting provides best relevance with low CPU cost
   • disable scrollbar to save a GTK widget draw call
   • fixed-height = false allows natural height → less blank space
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */